<!--
  Maxwell Library (library.bridgew.edu) - manually maintained sitemap
  Built 2026-09-09 by walking the site navigation and footer.
  The site runs on EBSCO Stacks 4.0.125.9 and publishes no sitemap of its own.

  49 URLs: 14 section pages, 12 sub-pages, 23 staff profiles.

  Deliberately excluded:
    /search-find           blocked by robots.txt ("Disallow: /search" matches it as a prefix)
    /searching-collections blocked by robots.txt for the same reason
    /calendar              JavaScript calendar view, little readable text
    /events/<id>           individual event pages, transient
    /events?page=          pagination and RSS feed URLs
    /user/login            blocked by robots.txt

  No <lastmod> values are included. The site does not expose modification
  dates, and inventing them would be worse than omitting them.

  Hours and research guides are NOT on this host. Point separate sources at:
    https://bridgew.libcal.com/sitemap.xml    (LibCal: hours, appointments, room booking)
    https://guides.bridgew.edu/sitemap.xml    (LibGuides: research guides)
-->
